This directory contains work under three different licences. They are listed
separately because they came from three different places.


1. THE BEAMER THEME
-------------------
beamerthememidcenturymodern.sty

    "midcentury modern", copyright Jules Leguy.
    https://github.com/jules-leguy/midcenturymodern
    Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

    Included here unmodified apart from six comment lines in its header.
    CC BY 4.0 requires modifications to be indicated: the list of what this
    template changes is at the top of tdstyle.tex. Those changes are made in
    tdstyle.tex, not in Leguy's file.


2. EVERYTHING ADDED HERE
------------------------
tdstyle.tex, slides.tex, check.sh, figures/trim.py, README.md

    Copyright the contributors to this repository.
    Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
    the same terms as the theme it extends.

    You may copy, adapt and redistribute this, including commercially, provided
    you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate whether you
    made changes.


3. THE FONTS
------------
fonts/EBGaramond-0.016/   EB Garamond, by Georg Duffner and Octavio Pardo.
                          SIL Open Font Licence 1.1 — see fonts/EBGaramond-0.016/COPYING

fonts/montserrat/         Montserrat, by Julieta Ulanovsky and contributors.
                          SIL Open Font Licence 1.1 — see fonts/montserrat/OFL.txt

    Both are redistributed unmodified, with their own licence files alongside
    them as the OFL requires. Neither is relicensed by anything above.

    Note on EB Garamond: this is Duffner's release, which has optical sizes
    (08, 12) and separate small-caps faces but NO bold. The Google Fonts family
    of the same name is a different font with weights 400-800. tdstyle.tex loads
    the faces by filename, not by family name, partly for this reason and partly
    because the smcp feature is only reliably found that way.


NOT INCLUDED
------------
No university logo is distributed with this template. figures/ expects a
logo-trim.png of your own; see README.md. An institution's mark is its
trademark, and a licence on the surrounding files does not extend to it.
